{"id":"int-f15feb65b1f098bb2591064162ff8484","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-28T13:18:43.434433Z","actor":"Jude Rajasekera","issue_id":"jira-markdown-export-co5","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Added src/http.js: createJiraClient retries 429/503 honoring Retry-After with jittered backoff, and paces all later requests down after a throttle (decaying over ~5 clean calls). Client replaces page at every call site, so arity is unchanged and pacing state is per-run. RateLimitError.rateLimited makes fetchAllParentIssues abort instead of silently orphaning the child, hasValidSession rethrow instead of reporting an expired session, and describeIssueFetchError stop blaming a valid issue key; attachments stay best-effort with a new rateLimited counter. JIRA_MAX_RETRIES (0-10, default 4) validated via intFromEnv. 142 tests pass; healthy runs gain no delay. Merged to main as 7a86e7f."}}
